    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "About first one, try to set `set_vim_settings = false`  in mini.completion config, and make sure your `completeopt` have one of `menu` or `menuone` and didn't include `noselect`, your can type `:h completeopt` for more information.\n\nThe second one might related to #886 .",
